## To release a new version, edit the version in the two lines below and nothing else.
## |cRRGGBB...|r in Title and Author colours them in the in-game add-on list; the version
## is read back through that markup, so it can sit inside or outside the colour.
## Title: |cFF69B4PB's Combat Assistant|r 0.4.1
## Author: |cFF69B4PinkBanther|r
## Description: Three hand-lettered countdown tiles for Major Brutality, Major Resolve and Minor Resolve (Meru-Sawa Style). Or pick the Ember Style: a tiny two-head-tall mascot pops up during a fight and tells you in a speech bubble when one is about to run out and when your health falls low. A sound tells you when you are crowd controlled.
## Version: 0.4.1
## AddOnVersion: 8
## APIVersion: 101050 101051
## OptionalDependsOn: LibHarvensAddonSettings>=20106
## SavedVariables: PBsCombatAssistant_Data

